Z||000005||Ed||09-01-2001||12:08 AM||||My car was in a crash recently (see THUMPED in archives).  <P>The body shop got a new 87 GT front for me with no problem.  Priced about the same as described.<P>Incidentally, if you're "doing it yourself" the earlier aero fronts will also work with minor modification.  We originally gave the shop a front off a friend's older parts car, but after they thought about it they wanted to use the "correct" part.  All other parts were furnished by me off parts cars in the reconstruction.||||reg||1
